WEBVTT

00:13.860 --> 00:18.280
Beyond the wall, there's
a sea, or so Armin said...

00:22.710 --> 00:24.290
But past the sea...

00:26.130 --> 00:29.500
I always wondered what's beyond that...

02:04.970 --> 02:09.980
"Smoke Signal"

02:11.060 --> 02:13.860
You just try to steal some food, Sasha.

02:13.860 --> 02:17.780
I'll get Captain Levi to chop you up
into nice bite-sized pieces.

02:17.780 --> 02:19.180
I won't! Probably...

02:19.820 --> 02:20.780
Say what?

02:20.780 --> 02:24.450
Hey! Did you guys wipe the dust and dirt
off your shoes before you came in?

02:24.450 --> 02:25.450
Say what?

02:25.490 --> 02:29.460
No, we didn't. Can't you see
all the stuff we're carrying?

02:29.460 --> 02:33.590
Do you seriously think that attitude
will satisfy Captain Levi?

02:33.590 --> 02:36.880
If I hadn't personally given your
sheets hospital corners this morning...

02:36.880 --> 02:40.300
Quit nagging! Who are you, my mom?!

02:40.300 --> 02:41.640
We're back.

02:41.640 --> 02:43.760
Wait, were you just chopping firewood?

02:44.140 --> 02:45.600
Gotta stay in shape.

02:45.600 --> 02:48.600
You got grabbed by a Titan!
You should be in bed.

02:48.600 --> 02:50.440
I try to stop her, but she won't listen.

02:50.440 --> 02:52.980
I saw her doing sit-ups earlier!

02:53.060 --> 02:54.900
How dare you, you peeping Tom!

02:54.900 --> 02:58.440
Mikasa, you do know you're
not a wild animal, right?

02:58.860 --> 03:02.600
It's almost like we're
back in the Cadet Corps.

03:03.120 --> 03:04.120
Yeah...

03:04.450 --> 03:08.580
Why do you figure we were chosen
for the new Levi Squad, though?

03:09.040 --> 03:12.420
Protecting Eren and Historia
is such an important mission...

03:12.420 --> 03:14.350
Because we're talented, I assume.

03:15.710 --> 03:18.590
Sasha... what did you
just put in your bag?

03:19.130 --> 03:21.430
Nothing bread-related.

03:21.590 --> 03:23.340
Why, you!

03:23.340 --> 03:24.470
Give it back.

03:24.470 --> 03:28.270
Hey, focus! We gotta finish cleaning
before the captain gets back!

03:28.270 --> 03:29.850
Put back the bread.

03:29.850 --> 03:30.980
What's this commotion about?

03:30.980 --> 03:32.270
How many times have you done this now?

03:32.270 --> 03:34.360
Our food reserves are precious!

03:34.360 --> 03:37.240
Cut the crap, Potato Girl!

03:45.620 --> 03:48.030
I'm quite sure I gave you enough time.

03:51.910 --> 03:53.290
Anyways...

03:53.290 --> 03:56.540
We'll discuss your lax
cleaning job another time.

03:56.840 --> 03:57.840
Eren.

03:58.210 --> 04:01.220
Hange is itching to get
the experiment started.

04:01.220 --> 04:02.490
R-Right.

04:09.560 --> 04:10.270
Eren!

04:10.430 --> 04:13.440
What's wrong, Eren?! Get up!

04:13.440 --> 04:16.650
The future of humanity is riding on you!

04:16.650 --> 04:18.900
Get up, dammit!

04:18.900 --> 04:19.900
Hey, four-eyes.

04:20.280 --> 04:22.360
He's not quite the same this time.

04:22.900 --> 04:27.070
He's not even 10 meters, and some
of his body doesn't have muscle.

04:27.070 --> 04:28.950
Plus, Eren's ass is hanging out.

04:28.950 --> 04:30.330
I can see that!

04:30.700 --> 04:33.290
Eren! Can you still move?!

04:33.290 --> 04:35.290
Give us a signal or something!

04:35.830 --> 04:36.830
Eren!

04:37.170 --> 04:38.170
Mikasa!

04:38.340 --> 04:42.410
Hey... That gloomy brat is
acting on her own again.

04:42.840 --> 04:44.430
Time to think up a punishment?

04:44.430 --> 04:46.970
No, there's no signal... We're done here!

04:47.140 --> 04:48.850
Eren!

04:51.140 --> 04:54.520
Hot! Hot damn, you are hot!

04:54.940 --> 04:57.190
Hange, wait! Eren is bleeding!

04:57.190 --> 04:59.940
Whoa! Check it out, Moblit!

04:59.940 --> 05:02.070
Eren's face! Hurry up and sketch it!

05:02.360 --> 05:05.700
Section Commander!
Are you lacking in human compassion?!

05:12.200 --> 05:14.040
Sorry, I got carried away...

05:15.040 --> 05:16.740
Looks like we've got a long road ahead...

05:18.250 --> 05:21.580
...before we can use the Titan
hardening ability to seal the wall.

05:21.960 --> 05:26.880
Yes... I knew we'd be grasping
at straws from the start.

05:26.880 --> 05:29.300
Strategically, it's not a bad plan.

05:29.300 --> 05:33.220
Instead of lugging tons of supplies,
all we need is to get Eren there.

05:33.890 --> 05:37.350
Whether or not we're grasping at straws...
all depends on Eren.

05:38.690 --> 05:41.940
Experiment's over! All
troops, disperse at once!

05:41.940 --> 05:42.940
Roger!

05:43.230 --> 05:44.860
Make sure there's no witnesses!

05:44.860 --> 05:45.860
Yes, sir!

05:49.280 --> 05:51.160
You ride in the same wagon as Eren.

05:51.700 --> 05:54.550
I'm headed for Trost District
with Hange's group.

05:55.910 --> 05:56.910
Okay.

05:58.580 --> 06:00.750
You must find her at once.

06:01.380 --> 06:06.420
Only she... She may know the truths
which even we cannot perceive.

06:20.900 --> 06:23.940
I see... Another failure, then.

06:24.860 --> 06:27.870
If the plan would have worked
out, we could have plugged

06:27.890 --> 06:30.660
the hole in Shiganshina
District in less than a day.

06:30.660 --> 06:32.370
It's because we lack information.

06:32.870 --> 06:36.750
Might be a different story if there was
a book about the hardening ability.

06:37.410 --> 06:41.670
But we have Christa. No, Historia Reiss...

06:41.670 --> 06:44.630
Maybe we learn about the wall through her?

06:45.840 --> 06:49.220
I read the entire report
about her upbringing.

06:50.510 --> 06:55.190
She's the illegitimate daughter of Lord
Reiss, and it's by no means a happy story.

06:56.600 --> 06:59.320
But the real mystery here...
is why a mere

06:59.350 --> 07:02.510
regional lord would know
the secrets of the wall.

07:14.410 --> 07:15.410
Eren!

07:15.870 --> 07:17.700
You should still be in bed!

07:17.700 --> 07:21.010
I'm fine. I already slept a whole day.

07:21.620 --> 07:26.590
Besides, it's my fault the strategy
for retaking Wall Maria got shelved.

07:26.590 --> 07:27.920
It's not your fault.

07:28.420 --> 07:29.690
So don't worry about it.

07:30.590 --> 07:34.930
All I care about... is getting
a chance to fight that Beast Titan.

07:35.680 --> 07:39.640
Whatever that damn ape is,
I'll never forgive it.

07:45.560 --> 07:48.150
It's about time to switch lookouts.

07:48.730 --> 07:49.730
Mikasa?

07:49.990 --> 07:51.110
Yeah.

07:54.990 --> 07:56.160
Must be nice.

07:56.160 --> 07:57.580
You and the others...

07:57.600 --> 08:00.330
You have goals in mind, even
though they won't be easy.

08:01.870 --> 08:06.880
But me, now that Ymir is gone...
I don't even know what I want.

08:06.880 --> 08:09.050
Don't you want to save Ymir, though?

08:10.090 --> 08:12.170
Yeah, but...

08:13.010 --> 08:15.010
Back then, I couldn't
believe what she did...

08:15.040 --> 08:17.280
Though, it's true I
wanted to save her.

08:18.600 --> 08:21.060
But now, I'm thinking differently.

08:22.060 --> 08:24.690
Ymir chose her own path in life.

08:25.400 --> 08:29.120
I have no right to change
that... and no need to.

08:30.940 --> 08:34.110
Finally, you're talking again.

08:34.110 --> 08:35.110
Huh?

08:35.410 --> 08:38.780
When we came here,
you told us all about yourself, but...

08:38.780 --> 08:42.910
Since then, you haven't smiled once,
and you rarely talk either.

08:43.620 --> 08:44.670
Because it's a pain.

08:46.670 --> 08:47.670
Sorry.

08:48.340 --> 08:52.590
That good-girl Christa who was
nice to everyone is gone now.

08:53.010 --> 08:56.220
Nah, I think it's better this way.

08:56.220 --> 08:56.720
Huh?

08:57.010 --> 08:59.730
Before, it felt like you
always put on a facade.

09:00.140 --> 09:02.600
It was so forced and
unnatural, it made me sick.

09:04.480 --> 09:05.600
I see...

09:05.890 --> 09:08.860
But, the you right now is pretty normal.

09:09.360 --> 09:12.170
A stupidly honest, but normal girl.

09:13.070 --> 09:16.240
Anyways, you have plenty of
time to think about Ymir.

09:16.240 --> 09:18.280
In a lot of ways, I...

09:20.830 --> 09:22.580
Wait... Wasn't that...?

09:23.120 --> 09:25.410
Hange and the others arrived!

09:25.410 --> 09:27.290
Gather in the main room!

09:30.840 --> 09:32.710
Huh? What was that?

09:34.380 --> 09:36.930
He's dead... Pastor Nick.

09:37.680 --> 09:39.140
He was murdered.

09:40.550 --> 09:43.050
This morning, in the
Trost District barracks.

09:49.690 --> 09:50.440
Hey!

09:50.440 --> 09:52.520
You'll disrupt the crime
scene, you damn Scout!

09:52.980 --> 09:54.740
Don't get any closer.

09:54.740 --> 09:56.780
This is our job, not yours.

09:57.360 --> 10:01.700
It's another robbery-murder.
They've been springing up a lot lately.

10:01.700 --> 10:03.950
Wha...?! I'm not buying that!

10:03.950 --> 10:05.540
His nails were torn off!

10:05.790 --> 10:07.500
Which unit are you in?

10:10.500 --> 10:15.050
Fourth Squad Section Commander Hange Zoë
and Executive Officer Moblit Berner.

10:16.010 --> 10:20.840
Your ranks mean practically nothing
when your branch is the trash that it is.

10:21.550 --> 10:25.310
Listen here... It was no
Titan that killed that man.

10:25.310 --> 10:27.430
A person killed another person.

10:27.600 --> 10:29.560
This work is out of your league.

10:31.230 --> 10:33.730
First Interior Squad?

10:35.780 --> 10:40.380
Why? What's the capital's Military Police
doing down south in Trost?

10:41.030 --> 10:42.910
What's so strange about it?

10:43.660 --> 10:48.200
Unlike you useless goons, us valuable
soldiers are busy getting things done.

10:49.120 --> 10:51.960
Oh! So that's how it is!

10:52.330 --> 10:55.090
You're right, I'm worthless, really.

10:55.090 --> 10:57.880
I'm so lucky to meet
great soldiers like you.

10:57.880 --> 10:59.590
Let me shake your hand!

11:00.470 --> 11:03.380
I see... So poor Nick was robbed...

11:03.930 --> 11:05.210
Such a pity...

11:05.850 --> 11:09.230
Did he ever have stuff worth
stealing in the first place?

11:09.230 --> 11:10.520
Of course.

11:10.520 --> 11:13.770
Everyone knows the Church's trinkets
are made from valuable iron.

11:13.980 --> 11:14.980
Huh?!

11:15.150 --> 11:18.280
Nick was a pastor for
the Order of the Walls?!

11:19.320 --> 11:20.860
What are you talking about?

11:21.240 --> 11:23.810
He was a friend of mine
on personal terms...

11:24.490 --> 11:29.250
But, as far as I knew the man,
he was just a chair-maker.

11:29.250 --> 11:32.080
I even wrote that on his
application here...

11:32.080 --> 11:32.960
Dammit, stop...

11:32.960 --> 11:38.920
Though, I guess this only means I never
knew Nick as well as I thought I did...

11:38.920 --> 11:40.840
Hey! Let go!

11:40.840 --> 11:43.010
Oh, I'm sorry! Forgive me!

11:44.300 --> 11:47.070
Well then, good luck
with the investigation.

11:47.510 --> 11:50.430
When you capture the culprit,
please tell them this...

11:51.020 --> 11:55.440
The things you did to him,
perhaps you felt were righteous and just.

11:55.440 --> 11:58.900
But, personally, I couldn't
care less about any of that.

11:59.280 --> 12:03.570
To you scoundrels, I will ensure
you're tortured alive like my friend,

12:03.570 --> 12:06.990
and experience suffering above
and beyond what you did to him.

12:06.990 --> 12:08.910
Yes, you'll be sorry!

12:09.370 --> 12:12.310
Pass along that message. Excuse us.

12:19.380 --> 12:21.720
Section Commander, do
you think they really...?

12:21.720 --> 12:25.050
Yeah... First Interior Squad, Djel Sannes.

12:25.260 --> 12:27.550
All the skin on his fist was split.

12:27.550 --> 12:30.520
Nick was tortured by the
Interior Military Police...

12:31.270 --> 12:32.760
And then murdered...

12:35.690 --> 12:38.100
I figured the Church
would want to deal with

12:38.130 --> 12:40.640
Nick since he was cooperating
with the Scouts.

12:41.280 --> 12:45.950
That's why I hid his identity and
had him stay in the barracks, but...

12:45.950 --> 12:48.370
To think they would use
soldiers to kill him...

12:49.280 --> 12:51.120
I was too careless.

12:51.120 --> 12:52.960
It's entirely my fault.

12:58.540 --> 13:01.880
The Military Police... Did
they torture Pastor Nick

13:01.910 --> 13:05.220
just to find out what
information he spilled to us?

13:05.220 --> 13:06.260
Most likely.

13:06.930 --> 13:09.820
But it was the Interior
Military Police, which

13:09.850 --> 13:12.300
means there's something
more behind it.

13:12.770 --> 13:15.640
So, how many nails did
Nick have ripped off?

13:15.810 --> 13:16.600
Huh?

13:16.600 --> 13:18.770
You saw, right? How many?

13:18.770 --> 13:23.490
I only caught a glimpse of him,
but all the nails that I could see.

13:23.650 --> 13:25.780
People that talk,
talk after one.

13:25.810 --> 13:29.000
If they don't, peeling more
won't make a difference.

13:30.160 --> 13:33.500
Pastor Nick... I thought
he was an idiot, but...

13:34.580 --> 13:38.340
He didn't turn away from what
he believed, all the way till the end.

13:42.170 --> 13:46.950
In other words, they have no idea
we've caught wind of the Reiss family.

13:47.720 --> 13:53.090
Though, someone in the government is up to
no good, and their eyes are fixed on us.

13:54.600 --> 13:55.600
Captain Levi.

13:56.230 --> 13:58.020
A message from Commander Erwin.

13:59.810 --> 14:04.160
I went to tell him about Pastor Nick,
but he sent me off with this.

14:05.030 --> 14:07.490
Everyone, out. We leave now.

14:07.990 --> 14:09.660
Leave no trace we were here.

14:16.710 --> 14:17.960
That was close...

14:18.460 --> 14:21.960
If we hadn't left right then,
what would've happened to us?

14:21.960 --> 14:24.460
But why? What would make
Commander Erwin...?

14:25.760 --> 14:28.260
New orders came from the government.

14:28.260 --> 14:31.140
There's been a freeze on all Scout
Regiment activity outside the wall.

14:32.220 --> 14:34.340
They're telling us to hand
over Eren and Historia.

14:35.770 --> 14:38.730
By the way, right after
he gave me the message...

14:39.270 --> 14:41.430
...the Military Police came for him...

14:45.440 --> 14:47.680
That's treating him like
some sort of criminal!

14:48.030 --> 14:50.470
Someone's not working
from the shadows anymore.

14:50.910 --> 14:52.950
They're moving for all eyes to see.

14:52.950 --> 14:55.970
To go that far to protect
the wall's secrets...

14:56.500 --> 15:00.470
What's more, why do they want us
to hand over Eren and Historia?

15:01.080 --> 15:04.090
Not to kill, but for them to obtain?

15:04.460 --> 15:05.460
Who knows?

15:06.130 --> 15:09.150
Anyways, it's clear the
enemy is after these two.

15:09.930 --> 15:12.220
Loitering around here is dangerous.

15:12.680 --> 15:14.900
We're moving her and
Eren to Trost District.

15:15.970 --> 15:19.400
Why? That's the same place
Pastor Nick was killed.

15:19.850 --> 15:22.030
It's worse to head towards the interior.

15:22.690 --> 15:25.520
With Trost in a panic, it
should be easy to slip in.

15:25.980 --> 15:29.570
And if somehow it comes down to it,
we can use these in the city.

15:30.150 --> 15:31.150
True...

15:31.320 --> 15:34.360
Plus, not knowing the enemy
puts us in a tough spot.

15:35.080 --> 15:37.410
We need to find out who's behind this.

15:38.620 --> 15:41.500
Hange, lend me some of your squad.

15:41.500 --> 15:42.540
Of course.

15:44.590 --> 15:47.380
All right, I'm going after Erwin.

15:47.710 --> 15:51.430
Moblit's with me. The rest
of you will follow Levi.

15:51.430 --> 15:52.430
Roger!

15:53.930 --> 15:54.930
Hange!

15:56.010 --> 15:57.010
Here...

15:58.060 --> 16:01.390
I remembered a conversation
between Ymir and Bertholdt.

16:02.020 --> 16:04.310
Didn't get time to tell
you, but it's here.

16:05.650 --> 16:06.650
All right.

16:07.270 --> 16:09.360
I'll take a look at it later.

16:10.400 --> 16:11.530
Hiyaah!

16:17.200 --> 16:19.540
They're rather quick on the move.

16:19.540 --> 16:23.960
Hmph... It's because that
little runt is actually disciplined.

16:24.790 --> 16:26.180
An acquaintance of yours?

16:27.460 --> 16:28.460
An old one.

16:43.230 --> 16:46.460
Try not to walk in a
cluster. We'll stand out.

16:47.020 --> 16:49.690
Eren and Historia, just walk normal.

16:50.320 --> 16:53.110
Why is the royal family's
flag hanging everywhere?

16:53.110 --> 16:56.410
Oh! Today must be the anniversary
of the King's coronation.

16:56.410 --> 16:59.450
Once a year, they hand
out a haul of rations.

16:59.450 --> 17:00.120
Oh...

17:00.120 --> 17:02.200
We'll begin handing out rations!

17:03.540 --> 17:06.510
King Fritz has heard of
Trost District's hardship

17:06.540 --> 17:09.210
and will donate the royal
family's reserves!

17:10.300 --> 17:13.380
There's enough for everyone!
Line up orderly!

17:13.380 --> 17:13.970
...Thank goodness!

17:13.970 --> 17:15.680
...Long live King Fritz!
...Thank goodness!

17:16.140 --> 17:18.970
What a King! He sure is generous!

17:18.970 --> 17:20.920
He's got more than he
knows what to do with.

17:21.600 --> 17:24.180
People are weak, especially
when baited with food.

17:30.320 --> 17:34.240
By handing out those rations,
over 60% of the reserves are gone.

17:35.030 --> 17:39.950
Don't you think it's a bit too much for
raising the people's morale, Lord Reiss?

17:39.950 --> 17:45.460
It's necessary. There was a need to raise
the public's approval of the royal family.

17:45.660 --> 17:48.420
More importantly, we need
that power and the vessel.

17:48.420 --> 17:50.210
And we must hurry.

17:51.750 --> 17:54.210
The Military Police failed again?

17:54.210 --> 17:56.590
I'll return and continue the hunt at once.

17:57.180 --> 17:59.710
No, we'll soon have what we need.

18:00.220 --> 18:02.070
"That" is set in motion.

18:16.490 --> 18:18.360
Watch out! Behind us!

18:24.160 --> 18:24.950
Armi...

18:24.950 --> 18:27.370
I mean, Christa and Eren!

18:27.370 --> 18:29.980
They got snatched away again!

18:35.670 --> 18:37.130
Will it really work?

18:38.300 --> 18:41.180
He looks absolutely nothing like me...

18:42.140 --> 18:44.470
That horse face? Yeah right...

18:49.100 --> 18:53.730
Yeah? You like that? Let me hear you moan.

18:53.730 --> 18:58.070
Well? How's that? Doesn't it feel good?

18:58.070 --> 19:00.700
I'm just dying to hear
your cute little voice.

19:07.410 --> 19:10.540
This is why I didn't wanna go
through this shit a second time!

19:11.380 --> 19:12.920
Screw being his body double!

19:12.920 --> 19:15.710
She’s more muscular than I expected…

19:21.640 --> 19:23.110
How's it going inside?

19:23.760 --> 19:27.020
If we don't hurry, they'll
see through Armin's disguise.

19:28.180 --> 19:29.790
And I feel bad for him...

19:30.230 --> 19:31.250
I see.

19:32.350 --> 19:34.610
How is your leg? Any better?

19:35.900 --> 19:38.620
I can move well enough. It's not bad.

19:39.360 --> 19:44.190
More importantly, these kidnappers...
They're nothing but amateurs.

19:44.910 --> 19:47.280
Why would they be using guys like this?

19:48.870 --> 19:52.920
You can handle the rest on your own.
I'm heading for Eren.

19:52.920 --> 19:56.340
Once you've dealt with the trash,
come and meet up with me.

19:56.340 --> 19:57.340
Roger.

19:58.010 --> 20:01.620
One more thing... I'll
tell you, just in case.

20:02.890 --> 20:04.450
Tell Armin and the others, too.

20:18.320 --> 20:21.740
You're sure, without a doubt,
it's Christa and Eren?

20:21.740 --> 20:24.240
Yes, they match the description.

20:25.120 --> 20:26.940
Huh? Where's the guard?

20:38.210 --> 20:39.210
What the...?!

20:44.890 --> 20:46.800
Don't you dare move.

20:49.520 --> 20:51.850
Conny! Is it really
just the four of them?!

20:52.140 --> 20:53.600
Yeah, that's it!

20:53.940 --> 20:55.460
Nobody else in the area!

20:59.320 --> 21:02.400
If you move again, who
knows where I'll hit?

21:02.400 --> 21:06.870
All right! First, we tie these guys up,
then we meet up with the captain.

21:06.870 --> 21:08.160
What do you mean?

21:08.160 --> 21:10.960
Captain's orders, and
he sends a message, too.

21:15.370 --> 21:17.600
Hey! Get outta the way!

21:21.300 --> 21:22.300
Captain?

21:22.590 --> 21:23.590
Well?

21:23.920 --> 21:26.390
The road is crowded, but nothing unusual.

21:26.970 --> 21:29.580
It's not much farther to Commander Pyxis'.

21:30.060 --> 21:31.520
How's the body double mission?

21:31.930 --> 21:32.950
A success.

21:33.770 --> 21:35.810
And yet, you don't look that happy...

21:36.190 --> 21:37.190
No...

21:38.480 --> 21:39.920
Something is wrong...

21:40.480 --> 21:42.650
The Military Police can't be behind this.

21:43.150 --> 21:46.850
They're far too arrogant.
They wouldn't use amateurs.

21:47.740 --> 21:49.220
This is more like...

21:50.410 --> 21:52.740
Assuming the wagon was being followed...

21:53.830 --> 21:56.290
And the group was trailing their target...

21:56.290 --> 21:57.290
Captain.

21:58.250 --> 22:00.010
The wagon's almost moving again.

22:01.750 --> 22:04.580
Nifa, have you heard
about Kenny the Ripper?

22:05.010 --> 22:07.130
The mass-murderer in the capital?

22:07.720 --> 22:10.680
The one that slit the throats
of over 100 Military Police?

22:10.680 --> 22:14.560
That's just an urban legend
from years ago, right?

22:14.560 --> 22:17.480
He is real, and the stories are true.

22:17.480 --> 22:18.480
Huh?

22:18.650 --> 22:21.480
I lived with him for a
while when I was a kid.

22:21.650 --> 22:24.080
What? Why would you even say that?

22:24.570 --> 22:26.150
This isn't the time to be making jokes.

22:27.070 --> 22:31.160
That's right... He wouldn't
care about using amateurs.

22:31.950 --> 22:36.410
If a group was trailing their target,
it would be from both rear angles, and...

22:37.000 --> 22:39.020
...a place high up, with a view...

22:41.790 --> 22:42.790
Nifa!

23:04.320 --> 23:06.510
Yo, Levi.

23:07.900 --> 23:09.960
You grown any yet?

23:30.010 --> 23:33.470
Oh? It don't look like you changed at all!

23:35.180 --> 23:36.970
Kenny!

23:40.940 --> 23:43.090
Kenny and Levi meet again.

23:43.610 --> 23:46.650
The enemy's target was Eren and Historia.

23:47.610 --> 23:52.430
In order to get them back, Levi and
the others must take aim and shoot.

23:52.990 --> 23:55.390
Next episode: "Pain."

23:55.390 --> 23:56.540
"Pain"
